"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4725030","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1846651706676638","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"announcement","title":"Gun Goose - Release date and price announcement","summary":"Hey guys thank you so much for playing the demo and supporting the game I really appreciate it! I'm happy to announce that Gun Goose will finally be launching next month on November 6.PriceThe price will be $5 USD (with regional adjustments) with a 30% launch discount so you can pick it up for for $3.50 in the first two weeksWhats in the full game?13 different guns including a sniper rifle, minigun, rpg and more! 7 arenas to gun and goose inGoose store where you can buy goose hats, goose colors ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T07:24:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1839676055890351","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"announcement","title":"Gun Goose Demo 0.5: Remastered Special Edition","summary":"Hey guys, i'm back again with an update to the most realistic goose simulator on steam! It has major graphics upgrades and other gameplay additionsMajor graphical upgrade. The game looks much better now!Better ramp up of difficultyGoose now has more healthchickens, fish, sheep now hold weaponsThanks for reading! that'll be it for now.If you would like to support the game, wishlisting the game and reviewing the demo would be greatly appreciated!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T09:21:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1836506165574988","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"update","title":"Gun Goose Demo 0.4: The MASSIVE Update","summary":"Hey guys, i'm back again with a massive update to the most realistic goose simulator on steam! It has a new final boss, major gameplay changes, polishes and some major bug fixes.New final boss: Survive long enough to fight A MASSIVE PIG! Dodge its homing truffles and defeat it if you can to earn a METRIC TON of score Changes to side boss spawnsBetter wave spawning and ramp up of enemy amountsStamina drain when aiming and flapping is now lowerfixed bug where Flying Fish don't charge at player and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T03:15:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165574988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1836506165547596","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"update","title":"Gun Goose Demo 0.3.1 - Little Big Update","summary":"A smaller update with weapon reworks and tweaksShotgun pellets and spread increased to make it more effective at close range and less of a sniperSMG magazine size and fire rate increased Health and attack pickups now spawn more frequentlyTweaked star system and score requirementsFixed bug where bullets never despawn, which was negatively mpacting performanceThanks for reading, that'll be it for now. I will soon be adding more content such as abilities, bosses and enemies so stay tunedIf you woul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T02:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1835871199311799","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"update","title":"Gun Goose Demo Update 0.3 Out Now!","summary":"Hey guys, thank you so much to everyone who played the Gun Goose demo, I wasn't expecting so much players already! Also some scores on there are pretty crazy and beat my high score of about a million lolAnyways I've released a new update to the demo that contains a new stars feature, enemy changes, quality of life improvements and bug fixes.Get big scores to earn stars on levels, which in the future will be used to unlock thingsSlightly Larger Chicken boss buffed - Faster speed and more powerful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T00:03:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199311799","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4192320-1835236783565722","game_id":"steam-4192320","kind":"announcement","title":"Gun Goose Demo OUT NOW!!!","summary":"very important historical event right here.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T11:44:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783565722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4192320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4192320":"2026-10-26T11:44:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4192320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:48Z"},"4725030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-1